<title>USA: Kiddie Academy sees &quot;liquidity problem&quot;.</title>
<headline>Kiddie Academy sees &quot;liquidity problem&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>BEL AIR, Md 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kiddie Academy International Inc said Tuesday that a private placement equity financing to address its capital needs has not been successful.</p>
<p>&quot;Unless necessary additional financing is immediately identified, the company faces a serious liquidity problem,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company added that its board is considering all alternatives to address the problem.</p>
<p>The company operates and franchises educational-based child care centers and also operates a wholesale and retail school supply and equipment distribution business.</p>
</text>
